==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[pussy]]-[[cat]]}}

# {{informal}} An affectionate term for a cat; same as '''[[pussy]]'''.
# A gentle or [[soft-hearted]] person.
#: ''He looks stern, but he’s just a big pussy-cat really.''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|a cat}} [[cat]], [[pussy]], [[kitten]], [[feline]], [[grimalkin]], [[kitty]], [[mouser]], [[tomcat]], [[malkin]]
* {{sense|soft-hearted person}} [[wimp]], [[pussy]], [[namby-pamby]],  [[milksop]], [[pansy]], [[sissy]], [[wuss]], [[poltroon]], [[candy-ass]]

